// RULE: GC-04 — a predicate that cannot be lowered is refused, not defaulted.
// WHY IT MATTERS: this lowered to `Filter{LitBool(true)}` on the pipeline surface, so the
// view returned every row. Thesis §11.5.7 said the site was pinned; only the SQL half was.
// EXPECT: NL0501
// STAGE: lower
view every_posting = postings.where(|p| p.no_such_column == 1)
    serve { consistency: snapshot, materialize: auto };
